{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Ignore undefined future fields when detecting error details.** The unknown-field branch is true regardless of its value, so `{ FutureDetail: undefined }` fabricates a `DurableOperationError(\"Unknown error\")` despite containing no information, producing spurious exception telemetry. Count only defined values and update that test case to expect `undefined`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs7-IivC","finding_digest":"d94b13925de13f929bcde1771412a3892a8f913b2055c6e240c5aba5c0f3547b","finding_id":"arf_v1_3ffrhes54e7zfg6n4f3rievdre","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts::tooperationinfo::unknown-error-detail-preservation","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts::tooperationinfo::unknown-error-detail-preservation","line":47,"observation_digest":"19abe2d534c9c342d4d6367aec3a53030069545eb994d413f9c138bcad92efdb","observation_id":"aro_v1_dgv6fvjuzhbufvgwgz5oyostam","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_3ffrhes54e7zfg6n4f3rievdre","published_at":"2026-10-13T20:26:49Z","review_id":"arr_v1_2itmgkee6nav3aqc6wcysznndq","reviewed_base_sha":"96e77ccadbc193e0f624d2ae1acee45b56c38313","reviewed_head_sha":"d3791d9ccc4a5405bc5094ee6b78cb7fcd20a76d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":43,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_3td5abhzelzocrf7aenixls4ez"},"pull_request":{"number":960},"record_id":"art_v1_twx3i7e23vxs2brlq3eooueirp","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T20:26:49Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
